{"connection_id": "BC-7d3a77a04b419eb0b272", "ref": "WLC:Job.7.17", "target": "sec3", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "soydas", "basis": "ء ن س / Hebrew אנש, table sound correspondence with BDB cognate note", "note": "The commentary places the human being under pressure; Job asks what frail human is that God magnifies him and sets his attention on him, using אנוש to turn divine notice into an anguished question amid suffering."}
